      "A 47.6 by 16.5-inch belt, the longest of the Amazon picks",
      "Extra-long side rails and a front bar for support on stepping on and off",
      "Starts at 0.3 mph with 0.1 mph steps; mute and screen-off buttons",
      "Folds with a soft-drop system, and the side rails can be removed to store it",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Removable rails must be refitted and tightened correctly every time",
      "Incline is only 0–2%",
      "One-year warranty; Redliro sells several similar models, so check you have the 400 lb version",
    ],
    bottomLine: "The pick for taller or heavier walkers who want long rails and a longer belt, on a treadmill that folds away.",
    description: "Redliro sells several treadmills for older walkers, and this 400 lb version is the one we would choose. The Amazon listing describes extra-long side handrails and a sturdy front bar, a starting speed of 0.3 mph with 0.1 mph adjustments, a 0–2% incline for a mild challenge, a 47.6 by 16.5-inch belt, a 400 lb maximum user weight, a console with large numbers, speed shortcuts, a mute button and a screen-off button so you do not need to bend to the power switch, and a soft-drop folding deck on two wheels. The side rails can be removed to make the folded treadmill smaller. The belt is the longest of the Amazon picks, which suits taller walkers and anyone who walks briskly, and the 400 lb rating matches the Exerpeutic's. Two cautions. Rails that come off must go back on properly every time, so whoever sets it up should check the fixings. And Redliro lists several similar models with different belts and ratings — 300 lb versions among them — so confirm the 400 lb, 47.6-inch model in your basket. The warranty is one year. Amazon listed it at $449.99 on 6 November 2026.",
  },
  {
    id: "lastforever-walking-treadmill",
    name: "Lastforever Walking Treadmill",
    brand: "Lastforever",
    category: "Best for Walking and a Light Jog",
    badge: "Fastest",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GVDL1BF2?tag=sktiger-20&linkCode=ll1",
    amazonLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    image: {"url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KgtA2ZoyL._SL500_.jpg","width":500,"height":500},
    reviewUrl: null,
    priceRange: "About $400 (Amazon, 6 Nov 2026)",
    priceBounds: {"low":400,"high":400},
