            Updated November 2026
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          The Best Treadmills <span class="text-[#5AA9FF]">With Handrails</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Most treadmills have short side handles near the console. For walkers who want something to hold along the whole belt — older adults, people returning to exercise, anyone less steady on their feet — a treadmill with long side rails makes a real difference. Here are five, and what to check before you buy one.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="#quick-picks" class="bg-[#FF5A1F] hover:bg-[#E64F16] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
            See the Picks
          </a>
          <a href="#good-handrail" class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm border border-white/20">
            What Makes a Good Handrail
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- Author & Meta -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-12">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 py-8 border-b border-gray-100">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="48" height="48" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full" />
        <div>
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight"><a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author" class="text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a></p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-tight">Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block w-px h-8 bg-gray-200"></div>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
          Last Updated: <strong class="text-gray-700">November 6, 2026</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="ml-auto">
          <SocialProof users="1.7k" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="not-prose my-10 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 m-0 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-gray-900">On the products below.</strong> We have not tested these
          treadmills. The five picks were confirmed on 6 November 2026 as currently sold on
          Amazon US, and the figures on each card come from the Amazon listing's own specification
          bullets; for the Sunny low-deck treadmill we also used Sunny's own store, as checked for our
          low-ceiling treadmill guide. Clinical machines such as the Landice L7 Rehabilitation
          Treadmill are sold through their makers and dealers, not on Amazon, so they are discussed but
          not carded.
          Where a listing left a figure out — most often the exact handrail length or the step-up
          height — we say so rather than estimate it. Prices change often, so confirm the price,
          specification and warranty on the exact listing before you order. Nothing on this page is
          medical advice; if you have a health condition, a balance problem or are recovering from an
          injury or surgery, ask your doctor or physiotherapist whether treadmill walking suits you
          and how to start. We earn a commission if you buy through the Amazon links on this page; it
          does not change which products we list or what we say about them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>


