          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Fastest:</span>
            <a href="#lastforever-walking-treadmill" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Lastforever Walking Treadmill</a>
            <a href="#lastforever-walking-treadmill" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Best Budget:</span>
            <a href="#yesoul-treadmill-for-seniors" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Yesoul Treadmill for Seniors</a>
            <a href="#yesoul-treadmill-for-seniors" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Easiest to Step On:</span>
            <a href="#sunny-low-deck-treadmill-extended-handrails" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Sunny Health & Fitness Low Deck Treadmill with Extended Safety Handrails</a>
            <a href="#sunny-low-deck-treadmill-extended-handrails" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
